v1.0
Fork of NearestTheETH\_Base\_1Y v1.86. 30-draw, 72-hour cycle, 90-day season.
Core mechanic: fixed BPS proximity bands replaced with dynamic percentage-based cutoffs.
Keeper submits cutoff diff values after price resolves, defining top 1% (T1) and top
\~15% (T1+T2+T3) of entries by proximity. T1 always has winners. No jackpot miss.
Seed/rollover: 10% of weeklyPool returns to prizePot every draw.

Parameter changes from 1Y:
TOTAL\_DRAWS 52->30, DRAW\_COOLDOWN 7d->72h, PICK\_DEADLINE 4d->48h
INHALE\_DRAWS 36->20, FINAL\_CALIBRATION\_DRAW 48->28, POST\_LOCK\_DRAWS 42->20
WEEKLY\_OG\_QUALIFICATION\_WEEKS 51->30, MULLIGAN\_THRESHOLD 17->10
OG\_UPFRONT\_COST $1,040->$600, ENDGAME\_SWEEP\_WINDOW 365d->180d
RESET\_REFUND\_WINDOW 60d->30d, JP\_BPS 3667->4000, P2\_BPS 2667->3556

Removed: TIER1-4\_BPS, BAND\_DENOMINATOR, JP\_MISS\_\* constants, tier1-4Band state vars,
p4Winners array (tierPools\[4]->tierPools\[3]), InvalidTierConfiguration guard,
JPMissRedistributed and TierNoWinners events.

Added: DrawPhase.CUTOFF\_SUBMISSION, t1/t2/t3CutoffDiff state vars, snapshotTotalEntries,
CutoffOutOfRange and InvalidCutoffOrder errors, submitCutoffDiffs() (keeper/owner),
CutoffDiffsSubmitted event, getCutoffState() view.

Draw phase flow: IDLE -> CUTOFF\_SUBMISSION -> MATCHING -> DISTRIBUTING -> FINALIZING

Tier pools: T1 40% of distributable (36% of weeklyPool), T2 35.56% (32%), T3 remainder (22%).

ABI CHANGE: getWinnerCounts() returns 3 values not 4.

