v1.5
Dynamic starting breath calibration. Single new function \_computeStartingBreath().
Problem: fixed BREATH\_START=700 (7%) produced T3=$5-7 at draw 1 with high 2-ticket
casual adoption (double entries without proportional pot increase).
Fix: at startGame(), compute minimum breath for T3 >= TICKET\_PRICE from actual pregame
state (OG count, casual count, double-ticket count).
breath = TICKET\_PRICE \* entries \* T3\_WINNER\_BPS \* 1e8 / (pot \* 9000 \* 2444)
Starting breath = max(OG-obligation breath, T3-floor breath), capped at breathRailMax.
New constant: T3\_WINNER\_BPS = 700 (7%).
ABI CHANGE: BreathCalibrated event gains 3 fields (ogBreathBps, t3FloorBps, estimatedEntriesDraw1).

