v1.58-P3
GEOMETRIC BREATH ENGINE. Replaces linear step-down with 24-iteration binary search solver.
\_solveGeometricBps(): finds max breath such that pot >= requiredEndPot after n draws.
\_simGeomPot(): pure helper, simulates geometric decay over n draws.
DRAW30\_PRIZE\_RESERVE=$5,000 added to requiredEndPot at all three calibration sites.
Obligation locked at startGame() (not draw 10). ogEndgameObligation frozen immediately.
Solvency check at startGame(): revert PotBelowTrajectory if pot cannot cover obligations
at breathRailMin across all 30 draws. Blocks pathological deployments (70%+ OG).
EMA update changed to 3:1 weighted blend (was 1:1). Zero-revenue draws decay toward 0.
avgNetRevenuePerDraw seeded using committedDoubleCount (more accurate for 2-ticket casuals).
Deprecated: BREATH\_STEP\_DOWN, BREATH\_BUFFER\_BPS, POST\_LOCK\_DRAWS, OG\_OBLIGATION\_LOCK\_DRAW.
checkSolvency() view added: pre-flight diagnostic returning (bool solvent, uint256 deficit).
Key fix: \_finalReturnCalibration omitted DRAW30\_PRIZE\_RESERVE from requiredEndPot. Solver
floor dropped $5,000 at draw 28, allowing prizes to consume the draw-30 reserve. Fixed.

